Package: nouveau-hpd-ddc-dkms
Version: 0.1.0
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, build-essential, patch, python3, binutils, bzip2, xz-utils, zstd, linux-source
Maintainer: Local Administrator <root@localhost>
Description: DKMS rebuild of Ubuntu Nouveau with non-DP HPD-low DDC fallback fix
 Builds Nouveau from the matching Ubuntu linux-source package and changes
 nvkm_outp_detect() so non-DisplayPort outputs with low HPD fall back to
 UNKNOWN, allowing DRM to probe DDC/EDID as the source comment intends.
